<title>UK: Laporte firm after disposal confirmation.</title>
<headline>Laporte firm after disposal confirmation.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Laporte Plc were up 11p at 667p by 0945 GMT on Friday after the specialty chemicals firm confirmed it was selling its European adhesives operation for 110 million stg, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The sale was expected but it has given market makers an excuse to mark the shares up,&quot; one dealer said.</p>
<p>Trading volume was meagre 20,454 shares, reflecting the quiet post-Christmas London session. The London Stock Exchange closes at 1230 GMT today.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
